Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:56.06,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop Episode 11 (Final) --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.67,0:00:06.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Get some bread and a drink for breakfast tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.69,0:00:07.43,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:09.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Without running!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:16.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Does he ever listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:23.61,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see... a cold means water,\Nsports drinks, and dairy products.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:27.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And something easy on the stomach. {easy to digest}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.18,0:00:30.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you wanna get something too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.03,0:00:31.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe some cereal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:32.88,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:34.34,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:41.77,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did I pass it on to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.85,0:00:45.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:50.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Viruses that cause colds lie everywhere. {cold's are caused by a virus, not bacteria...}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:53.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes you get infected, sometimes you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:58.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't worry about who passed it on though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.93,0:01:02.64,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I bring something for her too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:03.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.05,0:01:10.08,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:15.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, put it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:21.73,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:24.93,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing in the candy aisle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:29.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, what about breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.11,0:01:33.98,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It fell out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:03.87,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:03.87,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:16.21,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:23.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, we'll head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:25.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to wake your mom up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.77,0:03:26.79,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:29.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here's some food for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:30.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.95,0:03:32.55,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:33.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:34.69,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:39.07,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, Daikichi brought us food!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:42.67,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you ever hear what people say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:44.32,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Stop that, Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.45,0:03:50.25,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:54.61,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much for always watching over him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:58.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all! I should be thanking you for helping me with Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:03:59.99,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:02.42,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, she's completely fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:04.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She even went to school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:06.32,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.32,0:04:10.03,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. I'm glad you're better, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.03,0:04:11.25,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:13.73,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making that rice porridge again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:15.07,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.07,0:04:16.72,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll feel better soon too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:19.23,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.23,0:04:22.19,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's go throw my tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.19,0:04:24.19,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:29.58,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:30.83,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:35.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nitani-san, you might have caught Rin's cold while taking care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:40.06,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's throw it from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:41.63,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're so high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:43.63,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'll aim for over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:41.63,Overlap,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I meet a lot of people every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:43.63,Overlap,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I go to work on a crowded train too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:47.18,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows whom I caught it from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:51.43,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,So don't worry. It's just a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.17,0:04:54.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:58.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,At least let me take care of Kouki then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.81,0:05:01.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I just have to pick him up from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:04.69,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:08.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.86,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let's play some games!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:17.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.71,0:05:22.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, be sure to watch over your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:25.12,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:32.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:37.14,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The pudding and mini-drink are from Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:41.23,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:43.76,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Pudding is my favorite food!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.40,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:06:00.75,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Come quickly, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:03.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're up early for a Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:07.67,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I have jump-rope practice today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.67,0:06:08.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:14.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:19.02,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Now this one's loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:21.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Brush slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:22.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:24.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And stop touching it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:26.53,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:30.70,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:38.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't force yourself too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:41.30,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay, I feel better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:43.95,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for relying on you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:46.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please, it's the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:48.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't thank you enough. {OK WE GET IT, YOU WANT TO MAKE SWEET LOVE WITH HER}{lol Utz}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:49.54,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:51.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I thought Kouki would be good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:54.39,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He can't do it well just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:59.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you're jumping too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:05.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You jump after it goes over your head and comes down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:06.90,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:09.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then don't use your arms and legs at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.69,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:12.45,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Move your arms before your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:14.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Try it once, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:15.48,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.49,0:07:18.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, my turn! My turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:19.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:21.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're moving your arms in too big of a circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:23.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Keep them closer to your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.54,0:07:25.96,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:28.16,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're here early!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:30.84,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:32.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I guess they're morning people.{\i0} {lots of energy this early}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nobu-kun's a natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:42.66,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,He's got a big brother to copy, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.66,0:07:44.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:48.65,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you going to do it, Sayaka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.61,0:07:53.98,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She just lost one of her upper teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:59.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Man, even little girls don't have it easy.{\i0} {probably comparing to Kouki's lost tooth earlier}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:05.78,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan, what kind of case did you put your tooth in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:07.32,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get a cute one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:09.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:12.79,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't know parents keep their kid's baby teeth in cases for memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.79,0:08:13.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Memories?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:16.64,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,They sell lots of small cases. Cute ones too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:17.43,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:18.29,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.64,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Small?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:16.68,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Cute?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:20.34,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Mine's shaped like a butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:21.52,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:24.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Rin would definitely love that!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:28.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why didn't I know they sold those kinds of things?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:32.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I feel like this always happens now that Rin's with me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:36.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I start worrying over the smallest things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:40.41,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Daikichi, this is for you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:41.69,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I made it at school.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:41.70,Bd1,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(514,487)}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:41.70,Bd2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(512,644)}Daikichi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:41.70,Bd3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(716,461)}Daikichi's meat and potato
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:41.70,Bd3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(713,481)}stew is really delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:41.70,Be4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(693,623)}And he can run
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:41.70,Be4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(710,645)}really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:45.58,Cd1,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(202,716)}Daikichi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:45.58,Cd1,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(913,619)}And he can run
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:45.58,Cd1,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(957,703)}really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:45.59,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I was supposed to write something about you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:48.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:52.00,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.37,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:55.65,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's for when you lose your baby teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:56.94,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's a memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:08:58.01,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A memory?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.01,0:09:01.18,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kouki-kun's mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:02.68,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:04.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:06.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't that Kouki's?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.81,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's really no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.67,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I throw mine out the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:10.69,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:13.69,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But I've been throwing my teeth onto the roof all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:14.61,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:16.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:18.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You can throw some and keep others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:20.78,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:34.58,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, count me in for jump-roping too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:41.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're touching it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:43.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let it come out on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:48.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Although, regardless, it'll look like she took one to the face.{\i0} {lit. it'll look like she got punched in the face}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:50.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Maybe I'll tell her not to smile.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.81,0:09:52.73,Cit,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(903,423)}Citrus
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:52.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:56.24,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Let's hurry and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.87,0:10:00.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you grow again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:05.08,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,You're joining in too, Daikichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:07.64,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I could use the exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:08.83,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:11.46,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,It's not easy getting older.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.46,0:10:13.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wish I could slow time down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.25,0:10:20.24,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, Daikichi-san looks like a boxer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.67,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:24.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's less stress on my knees this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.17,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:29.64,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, teach me how to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:31.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:34.63,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you get to be the only one who looks cool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:37.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,At least learn how to jump-rope normally first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:38.85,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:42.81,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:44.24,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Teach me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:56.41,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,You're good at doing it backwards, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:57.26,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:57.26,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kids are really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:00.97,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, they're full of energy, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:02.88,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.88,0:11:04.42,Main,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Again! {they lit say "It's a draw/tie", which implies they have to do it again}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:04.43,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's like they're made of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:13.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Although, adults are really something too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:16.16,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Adults?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:21.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You guys probably already know this, but I'm not really Rin's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:24.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's been living with me for only about a year now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:29.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Before that, I used to live just to further my own ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:33.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but once she moved in with me, my life suddenly took a detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:37.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But you all have lived with your kids since they were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:43.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know I'm still new at all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:50.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but do you ever have doubts about never having time for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:55.31,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.31,0:11:56.63,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:57.54,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:02.41,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.45,0:12:07.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:13.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, wasn't the jump-rope contest today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:15.27,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.27,0:12:16.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.13,0:12:19.59,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.71,0:12:22.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How many did you do? {probably asking how many times did she jump}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:25.01,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,15.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:26.35,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Not good!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:30.56,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.22,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,203.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:38.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?! You jumped that many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:40.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Does that mean you finished first?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:41.94,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:43.74,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here's my certificate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:46.95,Cr1,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(580,274)}Certificate
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:46.95,Cr2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(622,378)}1st Year's Group
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:46.95,Cr2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.5\pos(650,475)}Backwards Jump-roping, 1st Place
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:46.95,Cr3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(652,652)}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.74,0:12:46.95,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You really did great! This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:50.46,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I could've jumped more the normal way though!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.46,0:12:53.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess they only let you go once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:54.37,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:13:00.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Still, at least I know how much you improved at jump-roping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:03.83,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:06.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I lost some! {weight}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:09.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:10.89,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.91,0:13:15.57,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,How much longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:18.22,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,About ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:20.59,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't forget to show them your wiggly front teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:21.99,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:24.89,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to stop touching it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:27.41,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll show them how to jump-rope too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:28.93,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:34.50,MainHigh,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I bet my parents will be shocked to see how much you've grown. {height-wise}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:38.69,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'll be taller than your mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:41.63,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's not get ahead of ourselves. {lit. I don't think you're there yet}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:49.29,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I should let Grandpa know too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:57.27,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:14:00.46,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, we've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:01.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:04.73,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Look how tall you've gotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:06.70,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Are you one of the tallest in your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:07.76,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:10.92,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,We would have come picked you up if you had called!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:13.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like she can't walk ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:17.47,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be taller than me at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:27.28,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hi, Auntie Kazumi! {we're not using onee-chan}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:29.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:31.33,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,I just came a little bit ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.33,0:14:33.09,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Those clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.09,0:14:35.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They used to be yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:36.17,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:38.68,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie gave them to me last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:41.93,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Let me see your teeth, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:43.01,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:49.48,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My two front ones are really wiggly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.73,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? Do they hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:55.18,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes they do, but they don't bother me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.18,0:14:56.45,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a tooth-pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:58.05,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.05,0:14:59.99,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't you help her out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:01.55,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Her gums are really red!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:03.62,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They're not that red...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:07.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, when I was a kid, you'd threaten to pull mine out with a thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:09.88,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my, I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:07.16,Overlap,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,A thread? {lol Rin's eyes}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.16,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to make everything easy to chew. {soft to chew}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.35,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:19.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Want some freeze-dried tofu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:20.92,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:22.80,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have some cooked beans too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:24.36,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:27.64,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Eat all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:34.23,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I love freeze-dried tofu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:44.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did one come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.67,0:15:45.71,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:50.78,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:54.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:55.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, get a tissue!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:56.63,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.63,0:15:57.91,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:58.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Use this for now, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.99,0:16:00.42,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,That's a wash cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:06.02,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,She's changed a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.06,0:16:08.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:12.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe this is what she's really like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:18.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mom told me you're getting married. Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.16,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:22.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's great. He sounds like a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:24.12,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:29.29,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,The only problem is he wants to have children right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:30.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.83,0:16:32.34,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you kidding?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:34.53,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Going out drinking, going to concerts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.30,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,going on trips and tasting new foods,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:39.21,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to do any of those things anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.21,0:16:42.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You should talk to him about it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:44.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:46.93,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not good with kids anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:50.23,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,And I definitely don't want to become one of those embarrassing moms!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.19,0:16:56.70,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know if I could give up my lifestyle for my kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:17:02.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think you'd manage if you really tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:05.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You'd have no other choice anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:08.50,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,Easier said than done, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:10.67,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:11.92,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:17.17,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm no father or husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.17,0:17:20.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And I'm definitely not a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:25.18,Main,Sis,0000,0000,0000,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:26.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:33.18,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's true I don't have the kind of time to go shopping or out for tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:37.15,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But, I do have time for myself at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:46.61,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And time with my son is time for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:47.71,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.71,0:17:52.67,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think there's anything really special about being a parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.67,0:17:57.63,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Just take a look around you.\NThere are parents everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:04.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.97,0:18:07.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:32.46,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Guess what, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:38.36,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My adult teeth are growing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:11.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey, Rin!{\i0} {flashbacks starting}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:18.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's just sweat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.97,0:19:20.97,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Daikichi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:25.42,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hurry!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:27.89,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Get ready!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:29.85,Sch1,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur2\p1\pos(950,721)}m 0 0 l 120 0 120 700 0 700{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:29.85,Sch2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.9\pos(951,516)}Tasu\N\NElementary\N\NSchool\N\NEntrance\N\NCeremony
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.61,0:19:40.52,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That vase...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.52,0:19:43.46,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Masako-san had one too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:47.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'll be right back!{\i0} {flashbacks over}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:11.27,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:13.84,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Now the other one's coming out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.35,0:20:16.95,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I need a mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.95,0:20:22.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm sure I'll keep fretting over the smallest things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:26.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But I'm sure they all do the same too.{\i0} {i.e. they all fret/worry/care a lot as well}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:31.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:33.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.99,0:20:37.41,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:43.99,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You look like a cat, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:45.25,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.25,0:20:47.13,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Send a picture to your parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:55.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It looks like I'll be happy whenever I see her smile like that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:57.99,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:21:00.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:07.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And I think that's just fine with me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.84,0:22:53.35,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1600)}Daikichi!
